---
---
<div class="nl">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="nl-inner rv">
      <div>
        <div class="section-label" style="margin-bottom:14px">订阅</div>
        <h2 class="nl-title">不错过每一篇<br><em>值得阅读的文章</em></h2>
      </div>
      <div class="nl-form">
        <p style="font-size:.82rem;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;font-family:'Noto Serif SC',serif;font-weight:300">每月约 2-3 封邮件，只包含真正有价值的内容。无广告，可随时退订。</p>
        <div class="nl-row">
          <input class="nl-input" type="email" placeholder="your@email.com">
          <button class="nl-btn">订阅</button>
        </div>
        <p style="font-size:.63rem;color:var(--muted)">已有 847 位读者订阅</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
/* NEWSLETTER */
.nl {
  background: var(--bg2);
  border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
  padding: 80px 0;
}
.nl-inner {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
  gap: 80px;
  align-items: center;
}
.nl-title {
  font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
  font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 3vw, 2.8rem);
  font-weight: 700;
  letter-spacing: -.03em;
  line-height: 1.15;
}
.nl-title em {
  font-style: italic;
  color: var(--accent2);
}
.nl-form {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 14px;
}
.nl-row {
  display: flex;
}
.nl-input {
  flex: 1;
  padding: 13px 18px;
  background: rgba(255, 255, 255, .04);
  border: 1px solid var(--border);
  border-right: none;
  border-radius: 2px 0 0 2px;
  color: var(--text);
  font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
  font-size: .8rem;
  outline: none;
  transition: border-color .2s;
}
.nl-input:focus {
  border-color: var(--accent);
}
.nl-input::placeholder {
  color: var(--muted);
}
.nl-btn {
  padding: 13px 26px;
  background: var(--accent);
  color: #fff;
  border: none;
  border-radius: 0 2px 2px 0;
  font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
  font-size: .75rem;
  letter-spacing: .1em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  cursor: none;
  transition: background .2s;
}
.nl-btn:hover {
  background: #6b59e0;
}
</style>
